{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.avif?t=1764870214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras_big/64a5643aa1b5d9400f0e90554d893cb1.webp?t=1764870214 width=1560 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a robot invasion that wiped out most humans from existence, a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >human calls to <strong>DELIVERYCIOUS</strong>, one of the few food delivering services left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a <strong>Delibot</strong> from the same company, must venture to another planet to deliver your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >food. Explore a kilometric building where all kinds of bots will try to steal your food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/c6b20bc6e68829723ad15ed498cf1328.avif?t=1764870214\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras_big/c6b20bc6e68829723ad15ed498cf1328.webp?t=1764870214 width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story while fighting with creatures beyond the comprehension of your little robot mind in this randomized</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RPG where you'll sweat for each roll of your attacks, collect <strong>Locacolas</strong> to trade them for upgrades and items to help</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you fight, WORK FOR THAT GOOD REVIEW <strong>DELIBOT</strong>, YOU CAN DO IT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/0e0a0ff4289313c62d39ff5b2af9f5e6.avif?t=1764870214\" width=1124 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex story where you'll get soaked into the mystery of an invasion, the survivors and your place in the cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > world you live in. Survive and see what the mystery of your own existence guides you. <strong>Find yourself. Look deeper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/8faa9867d7a19cc76afe24cf6a3588a1.poster.avif?t=1764870214\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664160/extras/8faa9867d7a19cc76afe24cf6a3588a1.webm?t=1764870214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>And remember! Customer is always right.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THIS_DOOR_GOT_HANDS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/e80bb22be09eb69f0c82411ec3de864e143fe0d6.jpg"},{"name":"Thank_you_friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/e7a7891a40330b0910fb327f92ceba3ea11c51e4.jpg"},{"name":"OH..._and_one_more_thing...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/9c964e7374b3ae3a686e207fe0a681af2c779c15.jpg"},{"name":"Embarrasing...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/150db50bed24e90018b458ee6b1b024a1d166348.jpg"},{"name":"Bad_review","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/aa291e1ca15c44b254551859b8e1c48f16ae7977.jpg"},{"name":">:O(","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664160/9f057a1dfa1efb911fe59e31ad54035146628ffd.jpg"},{"name":"Sense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a